  "catalyst_source": "https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2025/12/22/3209543/0/en/Amneal-Announces-FDA-Approval-of-Denosumab-Biosimilars-Referencing-Prolia-and-XGEVA.html",
  "catalyst_text": "Received FDA approval for biosimilar referencing Prolia",
  "detailed_catalyst_text": "The FDA approved the BLA for Boncresa (denosumab-mobz), a biosimilar to Prolia, for osteoporosis-related use. This provides a lower-cost denosumab option for osteoporosis patients and broadens access to treatment.",
  "catalyst_text_evidence": "Amneal Pharmaceuticals, Inc. (\"Amneal\" or the \"Company\") (NASDAQ:AMRX) and mAbxience, a Fresenius Kabi majority-owned group with partial ownership from Insud Pharma, today announced that the U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA) has approved its Biologics Licensing Applications (BLAs) for Boncresa\u2122 (denosumab-mobz), a biosimilar referencing Prolia\u00ae, and Oziltus\u2122 (denosumab-mobz), a biosimilar referencing XGEVA\u00ae.",
  "news_published_at": "2025-12-24T00:00:00Z",
  "open_price_gap_percent": "0.00597",
