  "catalyst_date": "2025-11-13",
  "catalyst_source": "https://investors.amneal.com/news/press-releases/press-release-details/2025/Amneal-Receives-U-S--FDA-Approval-for-Iohexol-Injection/default.aspx",
  "catalyst_text": "Received FDA approval. Launch in Q1 2026. ",
  "detailed_catalyst_text": "The FDA approved iohexol injection (300 mg iodine/mL), the first generic version of Omnipaque, as a radiographic contrast agent. It is indicated for intrathecal, intra-arterial, intravenous, oral, rectal, intraarticular, and body cavity imaging in adults and pediatric patients two weeks and older. This first-to-market approval expands access to a widely used diagnostic contrast medium.",
  "catalyst_text_evidence": "\"Amneal Pharmaceuticals, Inc. (\"Amneal\" or the \"Company\") (NASDAQ:AMRX) today announced the U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA) has approved the Company's iohexol injection (300 mg Iodine/mL), the first generic version of GE Healthcare's Omnipaque\u00ae (iohexol) injection.\" \"Iohexol is a radiographic contrast agent indicated for intrathecal, intra-arterial, intravenous, oral, rectal, intraarticular, and body cavity imaging procedures in adults and pediatric patients two weeks of age and older.\"",
  "news_published_at": "2025-11-20T00:00:00Z",
